# Gen AI & RAG Engineering Standards

## Prompt & RAG Discipline
- Prompts must live in dedicated version-controlled config files (e.g., `apps/backend/src/ai/prompts/`).
- Grounding Constraint: Instruct models: *"Answer only using provided policy context chunks. If uncertain, return ESCALATE with low confidence score."*
- Metadata Citation: RAG retrieval must preserve chunk metadata (`document_id`, `page_number`, `section_title`).

## Structured Output & Tools
- Enforce output structure using Zod schemas (decision: APPROVE|DENY|ESCALATE, rationale, policy_citations, confidence_score).
- Tool Calling: Validate tool input payloads with Zod before execution. Any destructive action requires explicit human confirmation via the dashboard.
